+**Kera:** In the archive. With the door open. That is the point.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1011: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** Then I will leave a lantern at your door.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1017: trailing whitespace.
+**Kera:** He said he can return her hours. A man who keeps an hour in his pocket is a man who has a mechanism.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1018: trailing whitespace.
+**Mahmut:** Can you build one?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1019: trailing whitespace.
+**Kera:** Not yet. "Yet" is doing a great deal of work in that sentence.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1020: trailing whitespace.
+**Mahmut:** Then what do you need?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1021: trailing whitespace.
