narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1022: trailing whitespace.
+**Mahmut:** Then we steal time from somewhere else.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1023: trailing whitespace.
+**Kera:** Careful. That is exactly what he would say.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1031: trailing whitespace.
+**Brin:** Stay on the road. The trees whisper; they do not bite.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1032: trailing whitespace.
+*A bell rang somewhere west. Every refugee stopped walking.*  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1033: trailing whitespace.
+**Brin:** Keep walking. If you stop for every bell, the road wins.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1034: trailing whitespace.
