narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1064: trailing whitespace.
+**Rikka:** Up is where the eclipse is. Up is terrifying.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1065: trailing whitespace.
+**Brin:** I told a knight to keep up. It would be rude to be late.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1066: trailing whitespace.
+**Rikka:** Then I am coming too. Someone has to build the barricade.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1067: trailing whitespace.
+**Brin:** You are going to set it on fire.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1068: trailing whitespace.
+**Rikka:** Only a little!  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1076: trailing whitespace.
+**Nixie:** Someone drew this road on purpose. Look, the ink goes around the shrine, not through it.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1077: trailing whitespace.
+**Mahmut:** To lead travelers away from the shrine?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1078: trailing whitespace.
