narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1079: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** Then whoever drew it wanted people to disappear quietly.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1080: trailing whitespace.
