narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1087: trailing whitespace.
+**Pippa:** It is a lovely hand, though. Whoever wrote it took care.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1088: trailing whitespace.
