narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1089: trailing whitespace.
+**Pippa:** It means somebody found you on a road and wrote you down so the bell would know you. That is not nobody.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1090: trailing whitespace.
+**Nixie:** You are going to make a song of this. Are you not?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1091: trailing whitespace.
+**Pippa:** Only a short one.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1097: trailing whitespace.
+**Nixie:** You are all Vales? Every one of you?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1098: trailing whitespace.
+*Seven small hands went up. Then an eighth, belonging to an old man who laughed at himself.*  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1099: trailing whitespace.
