narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1100: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** That is a better sermon than the cathedral gave.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1101: trailing whitespace.
+**Nixie:** The cathedral never got chased up a tree.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1107: trailing whitespace.
