narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1108: trailing whitespace.
+**Jori:** That circle is around us.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1109: trailing whitespace.
+**Nixie:** Yes. It moves. It is a very inconvenient home.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1110: trailing whitespace.
+**Odelia:** It is the only one I would follow.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1111: trailing whitespace.
+**Nixie:** Good. Then nobody is staying behind.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1119: trailing whitespace.
