narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1120: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** You counted twice.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1121: trailing whitespace.
+**Aveline:** I always count twice. Once for the living, once for anyone the bell might have missed.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1122: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** And if the count is short?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1123: trailing whitespace.
