narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1183: trailing whitespace.
+**Sable:** Do not speak. Nod. How long have you been here?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1184: trailing whitespace.
