narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1211: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** Please do not write it down.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1212: trailing whitespace.
