narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1219: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** You say that as if it were cruel.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1220: trailing whitespace.
