narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1221: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** And the elixir Fadyme carries?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1222: trailing whitespace.
