+**Sable:** So you are loud on purpose.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1254: trailing whitespace.
+**Rikka:** Quiet means the bell is winning. I refuse.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1260: trailing whitespace.
