narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1419: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** What is my measure?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1420: trailing whitespace.
+**Nara:** You walk slower on the left. You hide it well. Not well enough for a Vell.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1426: trailing whitespace.
