narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1459: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** You enjoy this.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1460: trailing whitespace.
