narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1461: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** Then do me a kindness today. Forget what you hear in that room.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1462: trailing whitespace.
+**Clem:** That is the one thing I am bad at.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1468: trailing whitespace.
