narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1471: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** I am asking you to let me choose when.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1472: trailing whitespace.
+**Clem:** Then choose before I have to carve it.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1478: trailing whitespace.
