narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1479: trailing whitespace.
+**Hana:** Maybe they could not write.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1480: trailing whitespace.
