narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1491: trailing whitespace.
+**Clem:** Every day. In my best hand.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1499: trailing whitespace.
