narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1500: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** And you went closer.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1501: trailing whitespace.
+**Vespera:** Of course. I am a scholar. It is our only vice, and it is enough.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1502: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** What did it cost?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1503: trailing whitespace.
+**Vespera:** Ask me in the next scene. I would like one more scene before I answer.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1509: trailing whitespace.
