narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1510: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** You traded your own time.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1511: trailing whitespace.
+**Vespera:** Knowingly. That is the difference between me and you. I chose my price.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1512: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** Do you regret it?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1513: trailing whitespace.
+**Vespera:** I regret nothing I learned. I regret how tired the mornings are.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1519: trailing whitespace.
