narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1530: trailing whitespace.
+**Vespera:** Hours can move between people. With a witness and consent. He is not lying about that.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1531: trailing whitespace.
+**Mahmut:** Then he can do it.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1532: trailing whitespace.
