+**Hana:** Oh.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1545: trailing whitespace.
+**Sable:** And every child is outside. So the shaking did not matter. Only the door did.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1551: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** You are not looking at my arm very carefully.  
