+**Fadyme:** Both are true.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1573: trailing whitespace.
+**Hana:** Both are true.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1581: trailing whitespace.
+**Thistle:** At the m-monastery we plant in bell-ash. Most things die. This one does not.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1582: trailing whitespace.
+**Mahmut:** What is it?  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1583: trailing whitespace.
