narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1592: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** Please do not tell him what it means.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1593: trailing whitespace.
