narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1594: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** That is fair.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1595: trailing whitespace.
+**Thistle:** I am sorry. It is a beautiful flower. It is a terrible flower.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1601: trailing whitespace.
+**Thistle:** Hold still. Wards are like fences. You mend them from the inside.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1602: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** You are not stammering.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1603: trailing whitespace.
