narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1604: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** Then keep your hands busy all night.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1610: trailing whitespace.
