narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1625: trailing whitespace.
+**Iona:** I would rather read it while you are here to correct my pronunciation.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1631: trailing whitespace.
