narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1634: trailing whitespace.
+**Kera:** ...Give me half. I have a loud voice.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1640: trailing whitespace.
