narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1649: trailing whitespace.
+**Fadyme:** Every night is a long promise.  
narrative/02_Main_Story/PART1_FULL_SCRIPT.md:1650: trailing whitespace.
